{"id": "sfo-runway-grant-reimbursement", "title": "SFO reimbursed the FAA for costs outside its airport grants", "seconds": 44.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.04, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "e81d336eea40fda6", "words": 120, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A federal audit found that the airport billed work outside a runway grant.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.12, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "grant", "for", "runway", "work"], "sub": "San Francisco International Airport"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.8, 1.01, 1.13, 1.23, 1.67, 2.0, 2.26, 2.73, 2.82, 3.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The audit assigned 832,813 dollars of ineligible Recovery Act payments to the airport.", "t0": 4.24, "t1": 10.4, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Transportation Office of Inspector General", "text": "2013 federal audit", "mark": "2013 federal audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.48, 1.0, 1.26, 1.62, 2.07, 2.52, 2.7, 2.93, 3.34, 3.71, 3.83, 4.41, 4.85, 5.08, 5.47, 5.59, 5.69]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Those items included taxiway and drainage work, and survey equipment.", "t0": 10.52, "t1": 14.08, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "2013 audit", "heading": "Items identified in the report", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Taxiway and drainage work", "value": "$772,000 approx."}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Survey equipment", "value": "$61,128"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.61, 1.01, 1.58, 1.68, 2.06, 2.55, 2.79, 3.16]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The airport agreed to repay the costs after investigators raised them.", "t0": 14.3, "t1": 17.75, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "repaid", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Transportation Office of Inspector General", "text": "Investigation and repayment", "mark": "Investigation and repayment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.46, 0.73, 0.84, 1.13, 1.25, 1.79, 2.1, 2.77, 3.04]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Investigators traced the purchases after auditors flagged equipment bought as runway work ended.", "t0": 17.87, "t1": 23.06, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "repaid", "kicker": "U.S. Department of Transportation Office of Inspector General", "text": "Survey equipment", "mark": "Survey equipment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.69, 1.02, 1.15, 1.72, 2.02, 2.45, 2.81, 3.74, 4.04, 4.18, 4.55, 4.85]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "They identified laboratory materials, electrical maintenance and flight services among the items billed.", "t0": 23.18, "t1": 29.08, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Items billed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.76, 1.31, 2.41, 2.99, 3.5, 3.69, 4.03, 4.48, 4.73, 4.87, 5.21]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "On January 9, 2015, the airport repaid the FAA 809,554 dollars.", "t0": 29.2, "t1": 36.06, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$809,554", "label": "January 2015 repayment to FAA"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.65, 1.09, 1.41, 2.33, 2.48, 2.92, 3.32, 3.48, 4.11, 4.32, 4.56, 4.76, 5.14, 5.38, 5.76, 6.35]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The audit figure and the later repayment overlap. Adding them would count costs twice.", "t0": 36.18, "t1": 40.7, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Reconciliation by item", "Personal benefit"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.74, 0.89, 0.99, 1.23, 1.69, 2.73, 3.05, 3.19, 3.37, 3.63, 3.98]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.82, "t1": 43.11, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.7, 0.91, 1.22, 1.33, 1.43, 1.69, 1.93]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "What the grant covered", "followup": "The investigation"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "number"}